# Frontend Environment Variables
# 
# IMPORTANT: This project uses a SINGLE .env file at the root level
# Copy the root .env.example to .env in the project root and configure all variables there.
# 
# Location: ../../.env
# Template: ../../.env.example
#
# Frontend-specific variables (must be prefixed with VITE_):
# - VITE_CORE_BACKEND_API
# - VITE_APP_URL
# - VITE_ENVIRONMENT
# - VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
#
# See the root .env.example for the complete template with all required variables.
